    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Explore and Test Your API\r\n\r\n**Goal**: Choose an API and confirm it works in your project before building your list view.\r\n\r\n1. **Choose Your API:** Select an API from the [curated list](https://studio.code.org/docs/ide/applab/expressions/startWebRequest) that fits your app idea and audience.\r\n2. **Make a Simple Fetch Call:** Write a basic fetch request using the API URL.\r\n3. **Inspect the Network Tab:** Check the Network tab to view the response data.\r\n4. **Identify Key Fields:** Locate 2 to 4 fields you will display in your card view, such as title, image, description, or id. Confirm they exist in the response.\r\n\r\n",
